raph_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010","quote":"　　權以交阯縣遠，乃分合浦以北為廣州，呂岱為刺史；交阯以南為交州，戴良為刺史。又遣陳時代燮為交阯太守。岱留南海，良與時俱前行到合浦，而燮子徽自署交阯太守，發宗兵拒良。良留合浦。交阯桓鄰，燮舉吏也，叩頭諫徽使迎良，徽怒，笞殺鄰。鄰兄治子發又合宗兵擊徽，徽閉門城守，治等攻之數月不能下，乃約和親，各罷兵還。而呂岱被詔誅徽，自廣州將兵晝夜馳入，過合浦，與良俱前。壹子中郎將匡與岱有舊，岱署匡師友從事，先移書交阯，告喻禍福，又遣匡見徽，說令服罪，雖失郡守，保無他憂。岱尋匡後至，徽兄祗，弟幹、頌等六人肉袒奉迎。岱謝令復服，前至郡下。明旦早施帳幔，請徽兄弟以次入，賓客滿坐。岱起，擁節讀詔書，數徵罪過，左右因反縛以出，即皆伏誅，傳首詣武昌。壹、䵋、匡後出，權原其罪，及燮質子廞，皆免為庶人。數歲，壹、䵋坐法誅。廞病卒，無子，妻寡居，詔在所月給俸米，賜錢四十萬。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010:m0183","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010:m0178"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"士匡往交阯告諭，與戴良別。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010:m0183","surface":"匡","start":183,"end":184,"kind":"person","person_id":"d5h_6xt_m2s","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010:m0191","surface":"匡","start":191,"end":192,"kind":"person","person_id":"d5h_6xt_m2s","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010:m0210","surface":"匡","start":210,"end":211,"kind":"person","person_id":"d5h_6xt_m2s","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010:m0231","surface":"匡","start":231,"end":232,"kind":"person","person_id":"d5h_6xt_m2s","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p010","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p01